  "goodToKnow": "Die Öffentlichkeitsarbeit is public relations, often just called PR: die Abteilung für Öffentlichkeitsarbeit. Public authorities, NGOs and clubs use the German term; companies often say PR or Kommunikation. Die Öffentlichkeit means the public: in der Öffentlichkeit stehen (to be in the public eye). Der Pressesprecher is a spokesperson. At 21 letters, it's a classic example of German compound nouns. It has no plural."
